WEBVTT

0
00:00:06.010 --> 00:00:09.170
The ADDI model was developed in 1975 by

1
00:00:09.170 --> 00:00:11.750
a research unit at the Florida State University

2
00:00:12.329 --> 00:00:14.930
called the Center for Educational Technology.

3
00:00:15.409 --> 00:00:17.899
They made an instructional system design process

4
00:00:17.899 --> 00:00:20.149
for the US Army because the military

5
00:00:20.149 --> 00:00:22.770
needed a structured and consistent way to

6
00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:25.409
train large numbers of personnel effectively.

7
00:00:26.229 --> 00:00:28.280
As the process proved successful,

8
00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:30.549
it was later adopted by universities,

9
00:00:30.629 --> 00:00:31.430
corporations,

10
00:00:31.510 --> 00:00:32.490
government agencies,

11
00:00:32.549 --> 00:00:34.709
and instructional designers worldwide.